# --- Corpus safety (docs/04-SMS-SAMPLE-COLLECTION.md) ---
# Unredacted message samples must never reach the repo. These patterns are in place
# before the first sample is collected, not after.
**/corpus/raw/
**/*.unredacted.json
*.sms.txt

